# ─── Rust build ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock IS committed — this is a binary crate and reproducible
# release builds depend on it. Do not add it here.

# ─── Release artifacts (produced by CI, never committed) ───────
/dist
/build
*.msi
*.dmg
*.deb
*.rpm
*.AppImage
*.AppImage.zsync
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.zip
SHA256SUMS
SHA256SUMS.*

# ─── Signing material — MUST never be committed ────────────────
# Release integrity depends on these never entering the repo.
# Private keys live in CI secrets and nowhere else.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.gpg
*.asc
*.minisig
secring.*
/secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Packaging intermediates ───────────────────────────────────
*.wixobj
*.wixpdb
*.wxsobj
/wix/obj
/wix/bin
/packaging/out

# ─── Test scratch and transient product output ─────────────────
# .kpart is by definition an in-progress write, never a fixture.
*.kpart
/tests/scratch
/tests/tmp
/tests/fixtures/generated
# Intentional .kzst / .kevat fixtures are committed under
# tests/fixtures/ — do not blanket-ignore those extensions.

# ─── Editors and IDEs ──────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.#*
\#*\#
.settings/

# ─── OS cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ─── Profiling and local tooling state ─────────────────────────
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg
*.profraw
*.profdata

# ─── Local working notes — intentionally unpublished ───────────
kevat-plan.md

# ─── Design & planning material — deliberately unpublished ─────
# The public repository ships code only; the plan is not part of
# the product. These documents stay on the maintainer's disk but
# are never tracked or published. Do not re-add them.
docs/design/
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/DECISIONS.md
docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md
CLAUDE.md
